<p class="copy">
	A specialized subset of <?php echo sf_lore_link('carriers', 'carriers'); ?>, Miners are purpose-built to carry and support swarms of asteroid collection <?php echo sf_lore_link('trucks', 'trucks'); ?> and <?php echo sf_lore_link('drone-craft', 'drone craft'); ?>. Most are designed and built alongside their fleet, with smelting and refinement facilities capable of turning the ores brought aboard into saleable commodities. Once a field runs dry, a Miner recollects its charges and moves on to the next, sometimes paying good money for a hot tip from a passing surveyor.
</p>
<p class="copy">
	Miners are a common sight in the asteroid belt, where claims on productive fields are often contentious. More than a few Miners have developed heated rivalries with the competition, and those rivalries can turn violent.
</p>
